@startuml
title Transaction - Full Lifecycle
hide empty description
[*] --> VALIDATE
VALIDATE --> RESOLVE : valid
VALIDATE --> FAILED : invalid options
RESOLVE --> BEGIN
RESOLVE --> FAILED : provider/resolve failure
BEGIN --> EXECUTE : transaction ready
BEGIN --> FAILED : begin failure
EXECUTE --> COMMIT : callback success
EXECUTE --> ROLLBACK : callback failure / rollbackOnly
COMMIT --> SUCCESS_DOC : commit returns normally
COMMIT --> COMMIT_UNKNOWN : commit infrastructure exception
ROLLBACK --> ROLLED_BACK : rollback confirmed
ROLLBACK --> FAILED : rollback infrastructure failure
SUCCESS_DOC --> COMPLETION
ROLLED_BACK --> COMPLETION
COMMIT_UNKNOWN --> COMPLETION
FAILED --> COMPLETION
COMPLETION --> [*]

state "SUCCESS [DOC MODEL]\nnormal return; not TransactionOutcome" as SUCCESS_DOC
note right
VALIDATE/RESOLVE/BEGIN/EXECUTE/COMMIT/ROLLBACK/COMPLETION
与 TransactionStage 对齐。

TransactionOutcome 只包含：
ROLLED_BACK / COMMIT_UNKNOWN / FAILED。
end note
@enduml
